Adapt wllama's rerank call to llama.cpp's new format_prompt_rerank signature.

llama.cpp d7d1b632d added query_files/doc_files parameters (multimodal
rerank inputs) between the document and the mtmd init options. wllama's
rerank endpoint is text-only, so pass empty file lists. Needed since the
Stage 0 llama.cpp bump; the return type (server_tokens) is unchanged.

diff --git a/cpp/wllama-context.h b/cpp/wllama-context.h
index 51682a6..3e9e1c0 100644
--- a/cpp/wllama-context.h
+++ b/cpp/wllama-context.h
@@ -762,7 +762,7 @@ struct wllama_context
 
     auto rd = std::make_unique<server_response_reader>(ctx_server.get_response_reader());
 
-    auto tokens = format_prompt_rerank(model, vocab, nullptr, query, document, mtmd_helper_init_opt_default());
+    auto tokens = format_prompt_rerank(model, vocab, nullptr, query, document, {}, {}, mtmd_helper_init_opt_default());
     server_task task = server_task(SERVER_TASK_TYPE_RERANK);
     task.id = rd->get_new_id();
     task.index = 0;
